"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b55a539f618a0b2155fe70a04f54","msg_type":"text","content":"<p>@_all 本月月度会及各小会改到14点半，五楼一二三会议室啦，请大家知晓</p>","sender":{"id":"ou_b96327e73fcd6743ef0f7f7e7d06d0d2","sender_type":"user","name":"李文娇"},"create_time":"2026-03-05T13:41:07+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b554e6a50e4bcc267141ed3ea968","msg_type":"text","content":"@_all 明日15点半在五楼四号会议室开月度会及各小会，请各位领导知晓","sender":{"id":"ou_b96327e73fcd6743ef0f7f7e7d06d0d2","sender_type":"user","name":"李文娇"},"create_time":"2026-03-04T11:08:57+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b55511164d4b4c3efb749afdcaac","msg_type":"text","content":"<p>https://delonix.feishu.cn/wiki/MkY8wm16RiCOw7kMdmfc1ef9n8c?from=auth_notice&hash=bb12619b8998ffcf3b97c8b3756d6df6</p>","sender":{"id":"ou_b96327e73fcd6743ef0f7f7e7d06d0d2","sender_type":"user","name":"李文娇"},"create_time":"2026-03-03T11:31:06+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b56e33ea294a4b2c83902bbde650","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card title=\"开元名都事业部房务月报（26年1月）通报\">\n各位总经理： 下午好！ 现将26年1月房务运营关键动作执行情况反馈通报，详见‌‌‌‌‌‌⁠‬⁠⁠‬⁠‬‬﻿‬‌‌‬ ‌‍‌﻿‍﻿‌⁠⁠﻿‍‍⁠‍‌﻿⁠‍﻿‍‌‬‍﻿‬‌⁠﻿‬⁠‌⁠‌‌‬‍‬‌‍﻿‬‬‌‬‌‬‍﻿‍‬‬⁠ ⁠⁠‍⁠‬﻿开元名都事业部房务月报反馈（2601） - 飞书云文档 分项细项表现如下 1. 会员营销动作执行反馈 百达屋APP/神灯系统可实现的功能日趋成熟，包括提前选房、一键开票、呼叫服务、AI管家、蓝牙开锁（部分酒店）等功能能有效提升客户在店体验。让“百达屋APP成为消费者的必需品”应成为所有成员酒店的共同目标。目前APP下载率仍处于非常低的水平，请各位总经理务必理解并做有效布置；对月报中提及的不到位酒店需要做出专项反馈。 统计口径变化：即日起，百达屋APP下载率不局限于OTA入住口径，而是调整为全量入住客户，即1503报表的7-3的指标，请各位关注。 2. 清洁卫生质量跟进 以华客系统卫生观点批评率为依据，21家酒店批评观点大于10%，其中10家酒店未有效落实大清洁/周期计划卫生提交工作，@吴姜@任晓宇@傅蔚箭@邹海军@叶蓓蕾@雷爽关注有效推进卫生清洁的落地工作。 3. 月报提交及数据异常情况 以下新开酒店请学习并规范提交月报房务运营月报填写规范要求@吴燕飞@王达@朱远生@李凤秋 @宋荷芳未及时提交月报，关注并及时补交。 如有疑问，可随时沟通。 DELONIX - 不一样，就是更好 ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 徐建平, Cecilia Xu 中国开元名都事业部 手机/M：(86) 13858051902 德胧集团, Delonix Group 深圳总部: 中国 深圳 前海合作区 卓越前海金融中心3栋33楼 杭州办公室: 中国 杭州 上城区 东宁路379号 雅加达办公室: Gold Coast Office - Tower Liberty Lantai 20 Room B, Jalan Pantai Indah Kapuk, Jakarta, 14470, Indonesia [图片]\n**发件人：**\n徐建平 <­xujianping@delonixmail.com­>\n**时间：**\n2026-02-24T09:22:51.883Z（2026-02-24T09:22:51.883Z）2026-02-24T09:22:51.883Z\n</card>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-02-24T18:01:43+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b57716b065cacc34e577d9dbd64c","msg_type":"text","content":"https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/WhVKdKffLoSiiMxc4zac8Y6lnun?from=vc_group_doc_link#doxcnOZe7nNt5nZ2moH3QCi8fKe","sender":{"id":"cli_a6ba21656ff1d00e","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-02-05T16:18:36+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b577155f4e080c3a19613c5dbb21","msg_type":"system","content":"","sender":{"id":"","sender_type":""},"create_time":"2026-02-05T16:15:47+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b5770e2921c84c4ccd4f77ff60e0","msg_type":"system","content":"Meeting has started. New messages will be synced in the group chat and in-meeting chat.","sender":{"id":"","sender_type":""},"create_time":"2026-02-05T15:46:14+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b5770e8231cc0b26760248a01cd2","msg_type":"video_chat","content":"<meeting>📹 2026年1月月度经营分析会\n🕙 2026-02-05 15:46</meeting>","sender":{"id":"ou_b96327e73fcd6743ef0f7f7e7d06d0d2","sender_type":"user","name":"李文娇"},"create_time":"2026-02-05T15:46:13+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true}],"has_more":true,"page_token":"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMBU3o12ctqn3q6LoSMqg7r1IwfRgbmkOoGZmSX0ccm112TUZxW-_EJMvRILAnatIZvA4D5yhHyASh9QIEoAXFXpWM56iiTrHXZynTc9rtPQV"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775592180822}}
{"type":"message","id":"2fae8c16","parentId":"8941a1bb","timestamp":"2026-04-07T20:03:00.824Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_8ayte8hq4fv2_2","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b523da7e7a4a0b24ce156f66230b\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"一楼商务自助4号5号晚上正常开，价格60/位周知@_all \",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-04T13:16:02+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53c152d618a8b2f6898c7381865\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"晁留柱 removed 晁留柱的AI助手 from this chat.\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-03T13:36:01+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53c0d13d18b0c3f269b0bd1e4c4\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"因账号欠费调用内置集成失败，请先充值, request id: 2026040313025424E805B2780F871B529C\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a93aa1cc63389cee\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-03T13:02:55+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b53c0d10aeca8b2523f37802fe43\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53c0d10aeca8b2523f37802fe43\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"五楼123需要撤台协助@_all \",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-03T13:02:52+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53fddcef1880c3bfccf5050a827\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"好的，收到会议通知！✅\\n📍 **会议信息**\\n- 时间：今日13:00（下午1点）\\n- 地点：五楼一二三号会议室\\n- 参会：@all 全体成员\\n我会准时参加的～ 💼\\n大家有什么需要提前准备的材料吗？😊\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a93aa1cc63389cee\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T12:03:46+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b53fddfe578b0c36ed96c06354e5\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53fddfe578b0c36ed96c06354e5\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"本日中午会议，地点五楼一二三号会议室，开始时间13点，请大家准时参加@_all \",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_2ad510ac5c0f020bb3396bbe78bfbcd5\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"胡珊珊\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T12:03:30+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53f244c3c8a0b366ba23edf7dc8\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210b_ce5908e2-175f-4ee1-acd0-23ea96b25edg)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T08:02:41+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53f2477544acb3b38176e8e3e05\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210b_439b37e4-5fc7-45ec-b2c7-59e15b18a49g)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T08:02:35+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538e660878b8c44f71008eb962c\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"【重要会议提醒⚠️】\\n各位同事：\\n明天（4月1日）中午13:00将召开德胧集团330品牌发布会精神同步会议，请所有人务必参加！\\n\\n📅 会议信息：\\n• 时间：4月1日 13:00-14:00\\n• 线下地点：五楼会议室\\n• 线上通道：会议开始前10分钟会在群内同步飞书会议链接，无法到场的同事请提前告知并线上参会\\n\\n会议非常重要，请大家合理安排时间，准时参加~有问题随时在群内反馈😊\\n\\n📌 会议日历链接：https://applink.feishu.cn/client/calendar/event/detail?calendarId=7141254821021024260&key=d56d8f15-fccc-4c10-bbc5-1d82d9273c31&originalTime=0&startTime=1775019600\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T18:31:40+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538e6b2a08b0b2c577f3a1cd1b3\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"晁留柱 invited 晁留柱的AI助手 to the group. New members can view all chat history.\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T18:30:54+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538e6bf8c0a8c37bd59fd3b2048\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"晁留柱 invited workbuddy应用机器人 to the group. New members can view all chat history.\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T18:30:43+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5303614ba084c2d6aa52f83c3d7\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_02104_c76e9824-4f4d-493a-8bed-27ca3e992fbg)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-25T13:30:32+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5302d820cca0c2dda4c4f5c8aa8\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"产品功能更新通知\\\">\\n📢 神灯住中对话及工单产品更新\\n为提升酒店运营效率，我们对工单系统进行了优化升级，重点解决一线员工实际痛点。以下是本次更新内容：\\n\\n一、分机账号工单类型选择范围拓展，最大范围支持接收全部类型工单，可选择：送物、清洁、维修、交通、餐饮、洗衣、入离、叫醒、投诉、紧急、咨询类工单。\\n\\n二、已完成工单详情页支持快捷复制工单号（工单问题反馈时需提供工单号）。\\n\\n三、工单播报提醒优化：iOS端APP后台活跃率优化，安卓端部分机型支持离线消息播报提醒（华为、小米机型支持默认设置为播报，OPPO机型需在系统设置页手动开启推送声音）\\n\\n四、修复bug：安卓端根据房号查询工单的展示问题。\\n负责人：@7479988310954901532\\n\\n如有任何异常或使用疑问，欢迎随时反馈，我们将第一时间跟进。\\n---\\n来自 [神灯住中产品更新](https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/Bdr7bjIedaV2JGspMUacrT1rnvd?ccm_open_type=im_card_workflow_link)\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-25T12:49:50+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53025f6c0934c42a0c3339d3237\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_02104_0f8a2fbf-68fd-4763-b2c8-cb8d4466f2dg)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_ee7f24ae094c816d44698ea32d00726c\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"王熹\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-25T12:14:18+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5306d56a28a0c3f75c0cd617797\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"尊敬的晁总，各位总监经理及同事们，上午好！按照百达屋聚力日，3月主题发布：聚焦消防，守护每一层楼的消防安全，于本日13：00在4楼5号会议室展开酒店全员消防安全基础知识培训，培训结束后邀请各部门总监经理一起做一次重点区域消防安全检查@_all \",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_64a95e7db51f7f832a39b8643668b4de\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"郑伟\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-25T08:18:02+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5440bafeb8b4c459ff83aaa54b0\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"接下来坐在工位上办公就会变成了一种形式了，因为通过手机加龙虾遥控所有的工作已经变成了现实\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-16T08:30:59+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5440bafe90acc4d4a1254de1b68\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/FssddYHSxo09rCx4AZBcbPJRnWe\\n我让arkclaw一键生成的培训分享文档，我一个字没写，坐享其成的快乐[笑容满面]\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-16T08:30:59+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54407a38d4a4c373fc94a89a143\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"📢 线上分享会预告\\\">\\n**会议主题**：会员营销政策落地解读 + AI助手（小龙虾）飞书应用分享\\n---\\n**1️⃣ 会员营销册政策落地专项解答**\\n- 针对落地执行中的常见疑问进行专项解读\\n- 开放互动问答，欢迎带基层问题上来交流\\n**2️⃣ AI助手（ArkClaw小龙虾）飞书场景应用分享**\\n- 分享如何在飞书环境中\\\"养好\\\"AI助手\\n- 实战技巧：用AI提升日常工作效率，助力绩效达成\\n---\\n📎 **相关培训文档**：[WorkBuddy与ArkClaw上手指南](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/FssddYHSxo09rCx4AZBcbPJRnWe)\\n💡 欢迎各位小伙伴带上基层同事一起线上参加！\\n\\n@所有人\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-16T07:39:59+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54032058d8a0b218c69b9705786\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"<p>给大家推荐一个好玩的“豆包”直接当你的“数字”员工场景,酒店的市场维度的各类例会,直接打开几个豆包,让它们各抒已见,然后,我们可以指挥它们PK观点,最终让豆包自己形成总结,当然,这个需要从一个开始,大家先体验免费“数字营销员工”的福利</p>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-13T10:31:05+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54032058b4bcb2c2f16aa51d9ee\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"media\",\n      \"content\": \"<video key=\\\"file_v3_00vo_0aa83bd2-23ca-4dee-86b4-609f4cd4b1bg\\\" name=\\\"2291822695.mov\\\" duration=\\\"50s\\\"/>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-13T10:31:05+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": true,\n  \"page_token\": \"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMBU3o12ctqn3q6LoSMqg7r0yivQsPnwt6QvWyiT51Au6H8gcqbVnqO0nFUiTGy1naaKOhBOL9CY9A-qLi78op_b-2AoZo3eC5vYBU7Q3lBXr\"\n}"}],"details":{"messages":[{"message_id":"om_x100b523da7e7a4a0b24ce156f66230b","msg_type":"text","content":"一楼商务自助4号5号晚上正常开，价格60/位周知@_all ","sender":{"id":"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a","sender_type":"user","name":"刘东东"},"create_time":"2026-04-04T13:16:02+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b53c152d618a8b2f6898c7381865","msg_type":"system","content":"晁留柱 removed 晁留柱的AI助手 from this chat.","sender":{"id":"","sender_type":""},"create_time":"2026-04-03T13:36:01+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b53c0d13d18b0c3f269b0bd1e4c4","msg_type":"post","content":"因账号欠费调用内置集成失败，请先充值, request id: 2026040313025424E805B2780F871B529C","sender":{"id":"cli_a93aa1cc63389cee","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-03T13:02:55+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b53c0d10aeca8b2523f37802fe43"},{"message_id":"om_x100b53c0d10aeca8b2523f37802fe43","msg_type":"text","content":"五楼123需要撤台协助@_all ","sender":{"id":"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a","sender_type":"user","name":"刘东东"},"create_time":"2026-04-03T13:02:52+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b53fddcef1880c3bfccf5050a827","msg_type":"post","content":"好的，收到会议通知！✅\n📍 **会议信息**\n- 时间：今日13:00（下午1点）\n- 地点：五楼一二三号会议室\n- 参会：@all 全体成员\n我会准时参加的～ 💼\n大家有什么需要提前准备的材料吗？😊","sender":{"id":"cli_a93aa1cc63389cee","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-01T12:03:46+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b53fddfe578b0c36ed96c06354e5"},{"message_id":"om_x100b53fddfe578b0c36ed96c06354e5","msg_type":"text","content":"本日中午会议，地点五楼一二三号会议室，开始时间13点，请大家准时参加@_all ","sender":{"id":"ou_2ad510ac5c0f020bb3396bbe78bfbcd5","sender_type":"user","name":"胡珊珊"},"create_time":"2026-04-01T12:03:30+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b53f244c3c8a0b366ba23edf7dc8","msg_type":"image","content":"![image](img_v3_0210b_ce5908e2-175f-4ee1-acd0-23ea96b25edg)","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-01T08:02:41+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b53f2477544acb3b38176e8e3e05","msg_type":"image","content":"![image](img_v3_0210b_439b37e4-5fc7-45ec-b2c7-59e15b18a49g)","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-01T08:02:35+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b538e660878b8c44f71008eb962c","msg_type":"text","content":"【重要会议提醒⚠️】\n各位同事：\n明天（4月1日）中午13:00将召开德胧集团330品牌发布会精神同步会议，请所有人务必参加！\n\n📅 会议信息：\n• 时间：4月1日 13:00-14:00\n• 线下地点：五楼会议室\n• 线上通道：会议开始前10分钟会在群内同步飞书会议链接，无法到场的同事请提前告知并线上参会\n\n会议非常重要，请大家合理安排时间，准时参加~有问题随时在群内反馈😊\n\n📌 会议日历链接：https://applink.feishu.cn/client/calendar/event/detail?calendarId=7141254821021024260&key=d56d8f15-fccc-4c10-bbc5-1d82d9273c31&originalTime=0&startTime=1775019600","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-31T18:31:40+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b538e6b2a08b0b2c577f3a1cd1b3","msg_type":"system","content":"晁留柱 invited 晁留柱的AI助手 to the group. New members can view all chat history.","sender":{"id":"","sender_type":""},"create_time":"2026-03-31T18:30:54+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b538e6bf8c0a8c37bd59fd3b2048","msg_type":"system","content":"晁留柱 invited workbuddy应用机器人 to the group. New members can view all chat history.","sender":{"id":"","sender_type":""},"create_time":"2026-03-31T18:30:43+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b5303614ba084c2d6aa52f83c3d7","msg_type":"image","content":"![image](img_v3_02104_c76e9824-4f4d-493a-8bed-27ca3e992fbg)","sender":{"id":"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a","sender_type":"user","name":"刘东东"},"create_time":"2026-03-25T13:30:32+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b5302d820cca0c2dda4c4f5c8aa8","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card title=\"产品功能更新通知\">\n📢 神灯住中对话及工单产品更新\n为提升酒店运营效率，我们对工单系统进行了优化升级，重点解决一线员工实际痛点。以下是本次更新内容：\n\n一、分机账号工单类型选择范围拓展，最大范围支持接收全部类型工单，可选择：送物、清洁、维修、交通、餐饮、洗衣、入离、叫醒、投诉、紧急、咨询类工单。\n\n二、已完成工单详情页支持快捷复制工单号（工单问题反馈时需提供工单号）。\n\n三、工单播报提醒优化：iOS端APP后台活跃率优化，安卓端部分机型支持离线消息播报提醒（华为、小米机型支持默认设置为播报，OPPO机型需在系统设置页手动开启推送声音）\n\n四、修复bug：安卓端根据房号查询工单的展示问题。\n负责人：@7479988310954901532\n\n如有任何异常或使用疑问，欢迎随时反馈，我们将第一时间跟进。\n---\n来自 [神灯住中产品更新](https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/Bdr7bjIedaV2JGspMUacrT1rnvd?ccm_open_type=im_card_workflow_link)\n</card>","sender":{"id":"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a","sender_type":"user","name":"刘东东"},"create_time":"2026-03-25T12:49:50+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b53025f6c0934c42a0c3339d3237","msg_type":"image","content":"![image](img_v3_02104_0f8a2fbf-68fd-4763-b2c8-cb8d4466f2dg)","sender":{"id":"ou_ee7f24ae094c816d44698ea32d00726c","sender_type":"user","name":"王熹"},"create_time":"2026-03-25T12:14:18+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b5306d56a28a0c3f75c0cd617797","msg_type":"text","content":"尊敬的晁总，各位总监经理及同事们，上午好！按照百达屋聚力日，3月主题发布：聚焦消防，守护每一层楼的消防安全，于本日13：00在4楼5号会议室展开酒店全员消防安全基础知识培训，培训结束后邀请各部门总监经理一起做一次重点区域消防安全检查@_all ","sender":{"id":"ou_64a95e7db51f7f832a39b8643668b4de","sender_type":"user","name":"郑伟"},"create_time":"2026-03-25T08:18:02+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b5440bafeb8b4c459ff83aaa54b0","msg_type":"text","content":"接下来坐在工位上办公就会变成了一种形式了，因为通过手机加龙虾遥控所有的工作已经变成了现实","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-16T08:30:59+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b5440bafe90acc4d4a1254de1b68","msg_type":"text","content":"https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/FssddYHSxo09rCx4AZBcbPJRnWe\n我让arkclaw一键生成的培训分享文档，我一个字没写，坐享其成的快乐[笑容满面]","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-16T08:30:59+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b54407a38d4a4c373fc94a89a143","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card title=\"📢 线上分享会预告\">\n**会议主题**：会员营销政策落地解读 + AI助手（小龙虾）飞书应用分享\n---\n**1️⃣ 会员营销册政策落地专项解答**\n- 针对落地执行中的常见疑问进行专项解读\n- 开放互动问答，欢迎带基层问题上来交流\n**2️⃣ AI助手（ArkClaw小龙虾）飞书场景应用分享**\n- 分享如何在飞书环境中\"养好\"AI助手\n- 实战技巧：用AI提升日常工作效率，助力绩效达成\n---\n📎 **相关培训文档**：[WorkBuddy与ArkClaw上手指南](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/FssddYHSxo09rCx4AZBcbPJRnWe)\n💡 欢迎各位小伙伴带上基层同事一起线上参加！\n\n@所有人\n</card>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-16T07:39:59+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b54032058d8a0b218c69b9705786","msg_type":"text","content":"<p>给大家推荐一个好玩的“豆包”直接当你的“数字”员工场景,酒店的市场维度的各类例会,直接打开几个豆包,让它们各抒已见,然后,我们可以指挥它们PK观点,最终让豆包自己形成总结,当然,这个需要从一个开始,大家先体验免费“数字营销员工”的福利</p>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-13T10:31:05+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b54032058b4bcb2c2f16aa51d9ee","msg_type":"media","content":"<video key=\"file_v3_00vo_0aa83bd2-23ca-4dee-86b4-609f4cd4b1bg\" name=\"2291822695.mov\" duration=\"50s\"/>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-13T10:31:05+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false}],"has_more":true,"page_token":"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMBU3o12ctqn3q6LoSMqg7r0yivQsPnwt6QvWyiT51Au6H8gcqbVnqO0nFUiTGy1naaKOhBOL9CY9A-qLi78op_b-2AoZo3eC5vYBU7Q3lBXr"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775592180823}}
