{"type":"message","id":"8cdef222","parentId":"d8452926","timestamp":"2026-04-07T20:03:17.519Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"These groups are mostly inactive in the last 24 hours. Let me check a few more promising groups - especially ones that might have been active recently. Let me check the AI虫洞 ones and some of the newer ones that haven't been fully scanned yet.\n\nFrom the tracker, the groups most recently updated include:\n- TJ-酒店市场外拓 (oc_219231f28537e99f7d06f65fdc89a78a) - mentioned as having activity on 2026-04-08 00:07\n- Let me check a few more interesting groups\n\nActually, I should also check some of the other groups that were noted in the tracker as potentially interesting. Let me also check:\n\n\n- 瑞湾开元酒店-市场部 (oc_4cf73464b14783398a0a4cb757adb89b)\n- AI虫洞项目-天津瑞湾开元名都酒店 (oc_8441e560e0223c30832dd17190e6469f)\n\nSince the tracker shows the last check was at 03:02 AM, and it's now 04:02 AM, I should look for any messages between those times, particularly in the groups that were marked as having recent updates like TJ-酒店市场外拓.\n\nI'm noticing several groups with expired or outdated activity - AI虫洞差评分享汇总群 (c20aa756) from April 5th, AI虫洞SOP群 (5f3cf744) from April 4th, and several others from late March - so I should prioritize checking the groups with more recent activity instead.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_sr56awuxle73_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_4cf73464b14783398a0a4cb757adb89b","page_size":20,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_sr56awuxle73_2","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_478a3ebc1a2cb50d9d84f7c53f573d5b","page_size":20,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_sr56awuxle73_3","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_86237b5f43c7a658380ed58861f52969","page_size":20,"sort_rule":