9490ab09b4e","msg_type":"text","content":"https://delonix.feishu.cn/sheets/IqJJsmWxAhVYyHtCfXbcrkp5n7f","sender":{"id":"ou_c4e9c812412a4ee50408af138178ef0f","sender_type":"user","name":"刘东东"},"create_time":"2024-09-18T11:53:33+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100ba161b95c9e280f4ba0cd7134e31","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card title=\"开元名都事业部酒店经营日报模版\">\n各位总经理： 大家好！ 暑期过后，经营淡季已经来临，为助力各酒店精细化日常经营，标准化管理维度，统一管理语言，事业部设计了《开元名都事业部酒店经营日报模板》供大家日常使用。同时事业部也对酒店进行了分类，分别由业绩总进行日常经营管理工作的盯进，也要求各位总经理每日将本酒店的经营日报抄送给对应的业绩总。 从下周三（9月 18日）开始执行！请每天上午12：00前通过以下链接提交： https://delonix.feishu.cn/share/base/form/shrcnjgvMLLnt2pZwmObfqtSpff 附件1 ：开元名都事业部酒店经营日报模版 附件2：酒店与业绩总对应一览表 DELONIX - 不一样，就是更好 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 金英杰，Frank JIN 中国开元名都事业部 手机/M：（86）136 8189 1871 德胧集团，Delonix Group 深圳总部：深圳市南山区前海卓越金融中心3号楼33层 杭州总部：杭州市上城区东宁路379号 [图片]\n**发件人：**\n金英杰 <­jinyingjie@delonixmail.com­>\n**时间：**\n2024-09-14T09:58:01.042Z（2024-09-14T09:58:01.042Z）2024-09-14T09:58:01.042Z\n</card>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2024-09-14T18:03:37+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100ba161b84830840f3d9abaf4d043b","msg_type":"system","content":"晁留柱 updated the group name from \"{old_group_name}\" to \"{group_name}\".","sender":{"id":"","sender_type":""},"create_time":"2024-09-14T18:03:20+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100ba161bbe33cf00f4e6c24a18c678","msg_type":"system","content":"晁留柱 invited  {from_chat} {from_dept} to the group. New members can view all chat history.","sender":{"id":"","sender_type":""},"create_time":"2024-09-14T18:02:58+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false}],"has_more":true,"page_token":"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMF1wmvvO29CF6jC1bNa2HxurbDOYChzVUM9Rnxx0G_Sz6_QCBvGpRott3vUeOPGoyeo4GfrHvVm3RATWTOdQHtBtpf2j1Yh77LkpHCjsK_So"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775592198376}}
