ype":"user","name":"方源兵"},"create_time":"2026-03-20T18:13:09+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b54fffcd6ac8cb32fcd990273d6d","msg_type":"post","content":"各位总经理，上午好：本次过年员工红包将由我逐一通过微信转账给各位，请大家收到后按对应金额转发给员工，并将**员工红包转账明细及截图**整理打包后发我留存，谢谢各位！\n![image](img_v3_02vv_ffcab90e-0477-4d0d-96a9-2b299866822g)\n@所有人","sender":{"id":"ou_42cf24dd179f2f2ef36952cab65f5aee","sender_type":"user","name":"方源兵"},"create_time":"2026-03-20T11:12:33+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b54ffe0b654c8b103cdc7175f1f8","msg_type":"post","content":"[rich text message]","sender":{"id":"ou_42cf24dd179f2f2ef36952cab65f5aee","sender_type":"user","name":"方源兵"},"create_time":"2026-03-20T11:11:35+08:00","deleted":true,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b548b745000b8c3bbd66d1eb24b8","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card title=\"【日报】虫洞门店服务日报（3.18）\">\nDear all： 稍早时的邮件中，服务运营分析表格在浅色模式下无法显示，故调整后重发一份，以下为虫洞（3.18）数据收集情况，请查收。 一、住中AI数据分析 1、数据概览（仅计入国内虫洞数据） 最近几天神灯活跃率波动较大，经和大数据平台还有数据波动较大门店沟通确认后做出以下分析： 16日绍兴开元名都酒店，诸暨耀江开元名都酒店，宁波开元名庭酒店等酒店均有接待大型团队，导致神灯活跃率大幅上涨；而后续大部分连住的客人因为全天在酒店参加会议培训等原因，没有和神灯发生对话，导致神灯活跃率跌落。 从3月份起，多家酒店（虫洞直营店为主）反馈陆陆续续开始承接各大型团队会议、培训、公司年会等需求，这成为3月份神灯活跃率波动的主要因素。 • 虫洞直营店 指标 数据 3.18 3.17 3.16 3.15 3.14 3.13 3.12 3.11 3.10 3.9 3.8 3.7 3.6 3.5 3.4 3.3 3.2 3.1 神灯使用 酒店数 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 神灯活跃对话房间数 2,169 2,151 2,441 1,545 2,621 2,256 1,987 2,004 1,995 1,456 1,258 2,110 1,689 1,579 1,644 817 1,037 1,049 反馈总量 3,983 3,934 5,118 3,140 7,299 5,214 3,837 3,859 3,874 3,036 2,714 5,279 3,806 3,323 3,436 1,611 2,062 2,338 神灯活跃对话房间数/过夜房间夜 54% 52% 68% 62% 60% 60% 58% 56% 57% 55% 52% 55% 56% 51% 60% 51% 50% 54% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行 53% 53% 60% 56% 47% 52% 59% 56% 59% 53% 49% 48% 51% 46% 48% 44% 41% 46% 客服闭环 0.60% 0.40% 0.50% 0.30% 0.50% 0.80% 0.80% 0.90% 0.20% 0.30% 0.50% 0.00% 0.10% 0.20% 0.20% 0.30% 0.10% 0.00% 小计 53% 5\n**发件人：**\n李勇桦 <­yonghua.li@delonixmail.com­>\n**时间：**\n2026-03-19T12:07:24.747Z（2026-03-19T12:07:24.747Z）2026-03-19T12:07:24.747Z\n</card>","sender":{"id":"ou_42cf24dd179f2f2ef36952cab65f5aee","sender_type":"user","name":"方源兵"},"create_time":"2026-03-19T21:01:30+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b548b74ecfca4c45d57e114cdfff","msg_type":"text","content":"<p>各位总经理：大家晚上好！现将3月18日虫洞门店日报发送给各位，请及时接收并审阅。请各位总经理重点关注一下酒店活跃率数据，谢谢。</p>","sender":{"id":"ou_42cf24dd179f2f2ef36952cab65f5aee","sender_type":"user","name":"方源兵"},"create_time":"2026-03-19T21:01:22+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b54892fdc28bcc33bea40c50643a","msg_type":"nonsupport","content":"[unsupported message]","sender":{"id":"ou_42cf24dd179f2f2ef36952cab65f5aee","sender_type":"user","name":"方源兵"},"create_time":"2026-03-19T18:55:13+08:00","deleted":true,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b548845573c8cc3bf445c990b6c9","msg_type":"post","content":"各位总经理，分享如下的内部工单发送技巧给大家\n1. **发送给指定员工：**在工单开头输入员工名字（注意不能有错别字），则只有该员工可收到工单，其他人不会收到。比如“李小明给310送一个毛巾”\n2. **发送给指定楼层：**在工单开头输入楼层（注意文字要和酒店后台设置的楼层一致），则只有勾选了该楼层的员工可收到工单，其他未勾选的员工无法收到。比如“三楼给310送两瓶水”","sender":{"id":"ou_8eaf04dc184ff7cc132f7c9c81d4b1ed","sender_type":"user","name":"阿荣高娃"},"create_time":"2026-03-19T17:24:09+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b5493e2e6a0b4b247a0d677c3f25","msg_type":"text","content":"各位总经理：大家下午好！现将3月17日虫洞门店日报发送给各位，请及时接收并审阅。谢谢","sender":{"id":"ou_42cf24dd179f2f2ef36952cab65f5aee","sender_type":"user","name":"方源兵"},"create_time":"2026-03-18T18:13:22+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false}],"has_more":true,"page_token":"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMF1wmvvO29CF6jC1bNa2HxurbDOYChzVUM9Rnxx0G_SzhRq-wrh8tlHOWoNvbNBQXCK10xLZiaURciO6aGvf_IanDubV9La-l83hY4RhDqGM"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775592198411}}
{"type":"message","id":"39484bcf","parentId":"0e09c48d","timestamp":"2026-04-07T20:03:36.670Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The groups are all inactive in the last 24 hours. Let me check a few more promising groups - particularly the ones that were noted in the tracker as potentially having updates, like the ones with recent dates. Let me also check the 1d8ce0d35fd7552e879cbebf55c36557 (TJ-月度质量经营分析会) and the c20aa75684a24daf54b1d25d7726d247 (TJ-Ai虫洞差评分享汇总群), which were noted as having activity on 4月5日.\n\nActually, looking at the tracker carefully, most of these groups have last updates that are:\n\n\n- tj月度经营分析会 (6456e9b68b2b2c678d9345b6d504e408): last update 4月3日, so not in last 24 hours\n- tj月度收益经营分析会 (24bd0ade3f2dea1ddd941a864e51bc28): last update 4月2日, not in last 24 hours\n- tj开元名都事业部经营日报发送 (478a3ebc1a2cb50d9d84f7c53f573d5b): last update 2024年9月, far outside the window\n\nNow I'm checking the other groups to see if any have been active in the past 24 hours.\n\nMost of the Feishu groups are from 2022-2024 and show no recent activity. The AI虫洞直营酒店群 had updates on 3月28日, which falls outside the 24-hour window. I need to verify the exact timestamp—the tracker notes \"TJ-酒店市场外拓\" was last updated at 00:07 on 2026-04-08, and I'm checking what the current time is.\n\nI'm confirming the current time is 04:02 AM on 04月8日, so messages from 00:07 today would be within the last 24 hours. Looking at the other groups like AI虫洞差评分享汇总群 and TJ-Ai神灯（虫洞）sop, both were last updated on 04月5日, which means they're also outside the 24-hour window. I should check the TJ-酒店市场外拓群 to see if it has any new content.\n\nThe AI虫洞差评分享汇总群 had some valuable information from 04月5日 that I should follow up on, though it wasn't updated in the last 24 hours. Looking at what I can see now, it's 4:02 AM on 04月8日, and I've already verified that 15+ groups have been scanned without finding anything new in the past hour.\n\nI'm now checking the TJ-Ai虫洞差评分享汇总群 and a few other potentially interesting groups to see if they have any recent activity I might have missed, even though the tracker shows the last meaningful update was on 04月5日.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wuc0hbgdpepe_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_c20aa75684a24daf54b1d25d7726d247","page_size":20,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wuc0hbgdpepe_2","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_219231f28537e99f7d06f65fdc89a78a","page_size":20,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wuc0hbgdpepe_3","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_5f3cf7446562a24632bb497c27723e24","page_size":20,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":15937,"output":834,"cacheRead":64955,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81726,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775592198415,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e07b501a-9b10-462f-8775-79f7ae0a1f18"}}
{"type":"message","id":"5ca5e8bd","parentId":"39484bcf","timestamp":"2026-04-07T20:03:36.979Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_wuc0hbgdpepe_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b522dd87720a0c2a39cefdffc102\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@刘东东 @魏安琴 把咱们集团330发布会的链接放上！ 说明ai趋势\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-05T07:06:19+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n          \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_2\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_9c9a96e3db30579a7992b6f6aa3e9b3a\",\n          \"name\": \"魏安琴\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b522ddaf2e4a0c30137e07d15862\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210f_fcbfa005-395c-43d6-9002-7e1df5bff3eg)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-05T07:05:40+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b522d139b40a0b21b13824bd02de\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@段艳 @赵炳涛 积极处理\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-05T06:51:01+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b522d12eeaca0b2d6a9b096b53f2\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_c043b57400c801eeda3e914a11cb3b28\",\n          \"name\": \"段艳\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_2\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187\",\n          \"name\": \"赵炳涛\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b522d12eeaca0b2d6a9b096b53f2\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"今日满房，问题客诉交接如下:第一，原0702现1111不满意小床并大床，房型差价同意后台携程退款，周知，第二，2318客人和AI聊天半天没有解决客人问题，有客诉，明日会再找我们，可以考虑优惠退差价方法处理掉，第三，部分客人有会员特惠的券可以免费用早餐的遇到就核销用餐，第四，系统1502换房至1516客人因为下午原1516烟味换走系统未操作，差点double了，现1502客人已致歉，客人没有投诉，1516需要保持关注，其同行为2308，周知下\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-05T06:50:42+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53fa8fa09098b26a07aa7cce689\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"美通社官网：https://www.prnasia.com/story/527449-1.shtml\\n搜狐：https://m.sohu.com/a/1003395381_629109?scm=10001.325_13-325_13.0.0-0-0-0-0.5_1334\\n新浪财经：https://finance.sina.cn/2026-03-31/detail-inhswavw3376035.d.html\\n网易：https://www.163.com/dy/article/KPBOVM3B05562SCF.html\\n雪球：https://xueqiu.com/1547221471/381963122\\n东方财富： https://caifuhao.eastmoney.com/news/20260331130700226065160\\n搜狐：https://m.sohu.com/a/1003395381_629109?scm=10001.325_13-325_13.0.0-0-0-0-0.5_1334\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T17:57:43+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53faf1f9f8a8b3fa39e499a2b69\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@刘东东 刚好20多个官媒报道我们虫洞ai是业内绝对领先，用这个去申诉，放上链接，客人们可以自证\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T17:57:07+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n          \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53faf291ecb4b2618b8858accf8\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210b_1c9a9638-6dfd-43dd-a865-6e546aa3d37g)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T17:56:22+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b549245ee54bcb36a67e41b94e8d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"任尚芳 assigned {to_chatter} as the group owner and left.\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-18T16:22:10+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b540d5442e0a8c443d9fb0ca139a\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@刘东东 可以编辑了\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-13T12:25:13+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b540c7bf844b8b3cb753c3ab18d6\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n          \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b540c7bf844b8b3cb753c3ab18d6\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"<p>我们没有预订，没有总机</p>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-13T11:24:03+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54033fa438b4b37c7c6ceb01aae\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"<p>https://delonix.feishu.cn/wiki/S49PwG5k1im2PskSPnCcBBOongb?from=auth_notice&hash=8297ad4843f35d744e5b25c2d71c1dc2</p>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-13T10:31:50+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54033fa418a0b3f642c61ee882b\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"各位总经理：上午好,现统计各酒店虫洞上线前电话接听岗位人员配置情况，请按以下要求填报:\\n- 设有独立总机岗：填写总机人数(含管理人员)\\n- 由预订部兼接电话：填写预订部总人数(含管理人员)\\n以上均需分别填报：\\n- 虫洞上线前人数\\n- 虫洞上线后人数\\n请各酒店于**今日 14:00 前**，按要求准确统计并反馈，确保数据真实有效，便于统一汇总分析。谢谢各位总经理.\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-13T10:31:50+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5402b08790f0b2472af9e3c15c1\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"【日报】虫洞门店服务日报（3.11）\\\">\\nDear all： 以下为虫洞（3.11）数据收集情况，请查收。 一、住中AI数据分析 1、数据概览（仅计入国内虫洞数据） • 虫洞直营店 指标 数据 3.11 3.10 3.9 3.8 3.7 3.6 3.5 3.4 3.3 3.2 3.1 神灯使用 酒店数 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 神灯活跃对话房间数 2,005 1,995 1,456 1,258 2,110 1,689 1,579 1,644 817 1,037 1,049 反馈总量 3,844 3,874 3,036 2,714 5,279 3,806 3,323 3,436 1,611 2,062 2,338 神灯活跃对话房间数/过夜房间夜 56% 57% 55% 52% 55% 56% 51% 60% 51% 50% 54% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行 57% 59% 53% 49% 48% 51% 46% 48% 44% 41% 46% 客服闭环 0.90% 0.20% 0.30% 0.50% 0.00% 0.10% 0.20% 0.20% 0.30% 0.10% 0.00% 小计 58% 59% 53% 50% 48% 51% 46% 49% 44% 41% 46% 调度酒店执行 AI调度 39% 38% 43% 45% 48% 45% 52% 49% 53% 57% 52% 客服调度 2.70% 3.10% 3.90% 5.00% 4.60% 4.30% 2.50% 2.80% 2.80% 2.50% 2.90% 小计 42% 41% 47% 50% 52% 49% 54% 52% 56% 59% 54% • 虫洞委托店 指标 数据 3.11 3.10 3.9 3.8 3.7 3.6 3.5 3.4 3.3 3.2 3.1 神灯使用 酒店数 21 20 21 20 21 21 21 20 17 9 3 神灯活跃对话房间数 460 445 420 298 560 345 292 239 106 25 29 反馈总量 995 886 893 646 1,705 957 615 548 266 79 75 神灯活跃对话房间数/过夜房间夜 26% 28% 30% 30% 36% 23% 20% 18% 14% 7% 24% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行\\n**发件人：**\\n李勇桦 <­yonghua.li@delonixmail.com­>\\n**时间：**\\n2026-03-12T12:25:26.446Z（2026-03-12T12:25:26.446Z）2026-03-12T12:25:26.446Z\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-13T10:01:08+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b541517c6bca4b2efdad3345e1ac\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"各位总经理：上午好，3月9日服务日报，请各位总经理查收。\\n9号日报提到的**核心客诉：**9条重点投诉工单，问题较集中，主要是\\n- 噪音问题（7条，占比近80%）：\\n  - 包含邻居吵闹、马路车流噪音、电梯噪音，甚至有因施工影响宝宝睡觉的严重客诉。\\n  - 建议：优化排房。在排房时，应将带小孩的家庭客、对睡眠要求高的客人，自动排在远离电梯、马路且非相邻的静音区。\\n- 餐厅管理（2条）：客诉集中在“早餐被打包带走导致断餐”和“餐厅有人抽烟”。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-12T09:23:28+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b541517c698a4b327441a3ead524\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"【日报】虫洞门店服务日报（3.9）\\\">\\nDear all： 以下为虫洞（3.9）数据收集情况，请查收。 一、住中AI数据分析 1、数据概览（仅计入国内虫洞数据） • 虫洞直营店 指标 数据 3.9 3.8 3.7 3.6 3.5 3.4 3.3 3.2 3.1 神灯使用 酒店数 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 神灯活跃对话房间数 1,462 1,258 2,110 1,689 1,579 1,644 817 1,037 1,049 反馈总量 3,046 2,714 5,279 3,806 3,323 3,436 1,611 2,062 2,338 神灯活跃对话房间数/过夜房间夜 55% 52% 55% 56% 51% 60% 51% 50% 54% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行 54% 49% 48% 51% 46% 48% 44% 41% 46% 客服闭环 0.30% 0.50% 0.00% 0.10% 0.20% 0.20% 0.30% 0.10% 0.00% 小计 54% 50% 48% 51% 46% 49% 44% 41% 46% 调度酒店执行 AI调度 42% 45% 48% 45% 52% 49% 53% 57% 52% 客服调度 3.80% 5.00% 4.60% 4.30% 2.50% 2.80% 2.80% 2.50% 2.90% 小计 46% 50% 52% 49% 54% 52% 56% 59% 54% • 虫洞委托店 指标 数据 3.9 3.8 3.7 3.6 3.5 3.4 3.3 3.2 3.1 神灯使用 酒店数 21 20 21 21 21 20 17 9 3 神灯活跃对话房间数 421 298 560 345 292 239 106 25 29 反馈总量 871 646 1,705 957 615 548 266 79 75 神灯活跃对话房间数/过夜房间夜 30% 30% 36% 23% 20% 18% 14% 7% 24% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行 54% 50% 38% 41% 32% 38% 35% 41% 39% 客服闭环 0.50% 0.00% 0.10% 0.00% 0.20% 0.40% 0.40% 1.30% 0.00% 小计 54% 50% 38% 41% 32% 38% 35% 42% 39% 调度酒店执行 AI调\\n**发件人：**\\n李勇桦 <­yonghua.li@delonixmail.com­>\\n**时间：**\\n2026-03-10T12:07:32.803Z（2026-03-10T12:07:32.803Z）2026-03-10T12:07:32.803Z\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-12T09:23:28+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b55ca63dc9cc0b2c99776c5ce1c6\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"<p>https://delonix.feishu.cn/wiki/WphswedTDiVYKqkBHYLcwfwznae?from=auth_notice&hash=f663bf0d16b27a9d81ee1ff65caaec68</p>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-10T17:22:25+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b55959a2b54a0b2813797db80fcc\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_02vh_3c2eb15a-9d01-4109-8ff2-19a42fd9154g)\\n昨日新增大众点评下载APP差评如上，已按规范进行回复\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-06T08:18:22+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b55a4dae0e4a0b341afacb0191b9\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"file\",\n      \"content\": \"<file key=\\\"file_v3_00vg_826d145d-17b3-471f-97e5-b0731e1c33fg\\\" name=\\\"202601-02 虫洞小组及直营店-集团客服投诉.xlsx\\\"/>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-05T12:40:34+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b55a4dae0d8a8b2d9c8927cbdbf5\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"file\",\n      \"content\": \"<file key=\\\"file_v3_00vg_f6454300-ff9d-4e36-aa44-85de89ae0d7g\\\" name=\\\"202602 虫洞小组及直营店+OTA差评.xlsx\\\"/>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-05T12:40:34+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b55a4dae0b0acb4bfa6185bd9fa4\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"各位总经理：中午好，近期，集团中央客服中心汇总了部分酒店的客人投诉记录，以及近期在各大OTA渠道（携程、美团等）产生的差评数据。今天我们在会上会向大家了解一下这些差评情况，请各位总经理对本店涉及的客诉和差评单进行复盘。会上我们会邀请部分总经理对以下两点进行说明：\\n1. 当时现场的实际发生情况是什么？\\n2. 事后采取了哪些实质性的挽回与追踪措施？（对客人的安抚补偿、对内部流程的优化或对相关责任人的处理）。请各位总经理知晓，谢谢。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-05T12:40:34+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": true,\n  \"page_token\": \"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMGvgJpAyyfJK_FZWeDRpwxANpFIYU7IU89Mp5e-azRMkb0h7KwIj65NWj5qsNSqYq6AN_foYmoHrqKBFXbNLsX2Dq3pOOofSfu4xzi7io2d-\"\n}"}],"details":{"messages":[{"message_id":"om_x100b522dd87720a0c2a39cefdffc102","msg_type":"text","content":"@刘东东 @魏安琴 把咱们集团330发布会的链接放上！ 说明ai趋势","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-05T07:06:19+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a","name":"刘东东"},{"key":"@_user_2","id":"ou_9c9a96e3db30579a7992b6f6aa3e9b3a","name":"魏安琴"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b522ddaf2e4a0c30137e07d15862","msg_type":"image","content":"![image](img_v3_0210f_fcbfa005-395c-43d6-9002-7e1df5bff3eg)","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-05T07:05:40+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b522d139b40a0b21b13824bd02de","msg_type":"text","content":"@段艳 @赵炳涛 积极处理","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-05T06:51:01+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"reply_to":"om_x100b522d12eeaca0b2d6a9b096b53f2","mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_c043b57400c801eeda3e914a11cb3b28","name":"段艳"},{"key":"@_user_2","id":"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187","name":"赵炳涛"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b522d12eeaca0b2d6a9b096b53f2","msg_type":"text","content":"今日满房，问题客诉交接如下:第一，原0702现1111不满意小床并大床，房型差价同意后台携程退款，周知，第二，2318客人和AI聊天半天没有解决客人问题，有客诉，明日会再找我们，可以考虑优惠退差价方法处理掉，第三，部分客人有会员特惠的券可以免费用早餐的遇到就核销用餐，第四，系统1502换房至1516客人因为下午原1516烟味换走系统未操作，差点double了，现1502客人已致歉，客人没有投诉，1516需要保持关注，其同行为2308，周知下","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-05T06:50:42+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b53fa8fa09098b26a07aa7cce689","msg_type":"text","content":"美通社官网：https://www.prnasia.com/story/527449-1.shtml\n搜狐：https://m.sohu.com/a/1003395381_629109?scm=10001.325_13-325_13.0.0-0-0-0-0.5_1334\n新浪财经：https://finance.sina.cn/2026-03-31/detail-inhswavw3376035.d.html\n网易：https://www.163.com/dy/article/KPBOVM3B05562SCF.html\n雪球：https://xueqiu.com/1547221471/381963122\n东方财富： https://caifuhao.eastmoney.com/news/20260331130700226065160\n搜狐：https://m.sohu.com/a/1003395381_629109?scm=10001.325_13-325_13.0.0-0-0-0-0.5_1334","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-01T17:57:43+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b53faf1f9f8a8b3fa39e499a2b69","msg_type":"text","content":"@刘东东 刚好20多个官媒报道我们虫洞ai是业内绝对领先，用这个去申诉，放上链接，客人们可以自证","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-01T17:57:07+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a","name":"刘东东"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b53faf291ecb4b2618b8858accf8","msg_type":"image","content":"![image](img_v3_0210b_1c9a9638-6dfd-43dd-a865-6e546aa3d37g)","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-01T17:56:22+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b549245ee54bcb36a67e41b94e8d","msg_type":"system","content":"任尚芳 assigned {to_chatter} as the group owner and left.","sender":{"id":"","sender_type":""},"create_time":"2026-03-18T16:22:10+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b540d5442e0a8c443d9fb0ca139a","msg_type":"text","content":"@刘东东 可以编辑了","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-13T12:25:13+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"reply_to":"om_x100b540c7bf844b8b3cb753c3ab18d6","mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a","name":"刘东东"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b540c7bf844b8b3cb753c3ab18d6","msg_type":"text","content":"<p>我们没有预订，没有总机</p>","sender":{"id":"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a","sender_type":"user","name":"刘东东"},"create_time":"2026-03-13T11:24:03+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b54033fa438b4b37c7c6ceb01aae","msg_type":"text","content":"<p>https://delonix.feishu.cn/wiki/S49PwG5k1im2PskSPnCcBBOongb?from=auth_notice&hash=8297ad4843f35d744e5b25c2d71c1dc2</p>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-13T10:31:50+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b54033fa418a0b3f642c61ee882b","msg_type":"post","content":"各位总经理：上午好,现统计各酒店虫洞上线前电话接听岗位人员配置情况，请按以下要求填报:\n- 设有独立总机岗：填写总机人数(含管理人员)\n- 由预订部兼接电话：填写预订部总人数(含管理人员)\n以上均需分别填报：\n- 虫洞上线前人数\n- 虫洞上线后人数\n请各酒店于**今日 14:00 前**，按要求准确统计并反馈，确保数据真实有效，便于统一汇总分析。谢谢各位总经理.","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-13T10:31:50+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b5402b08790f0b2472af9e3c15c1","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card title=\"【日报】虫洞门店服务日报（3.11）\">\nDear all： 以下为虫洞（3.11）数据收集情况，请查收。 一、住中AI数据分析 1、数据概览（仅计入国内虫洞数据） • 虫洞直营店 指标 数据 3.11 3.10 3.9 3.8 3.7 3.6 3.5 3.4 3.3 3.2 3.1 神灯使用 酒店数 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 神灯活跃对话房间数 2,005 1,995 1,456 1,258 2,110 1,689 1,579 1,644 817 1,037 1,049 反馈总量 3,844 3,874 3,036 2,714 5,279 3,806 3,323 3,436 1,611 2,062 2,338 神灯活跃对话房间数/过夜房间夜 56% 57% 55% 52% 55% 56% 51% 60% 51% 50% 54% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行 57% 59% 53% 49% 48% 51% 46% 48% 44% 41% 46% 客服闭环 0.90% 0.20% 0.30% 0.50% 0.00% 0.10% 0.20% 0.20% 0.30% 0.10% 0.00% 小计 58% 59% 53% 50% 48% 51% 46% 49% 44% 41% 46% 调度酒店执行 AI调度 39% 38% 43% 45% 48% 45% 52% 49% 53% 57% 52% 客服调度 2.70% 3.10% 3.90% 5.00% 4.60% 4.30% 2.50% 2.80% 2.80% 2.50% 2.90% 小计 42% 41% 47% 50% 52% 49% 54% 52% 56% 59% 54% • 虫洞委托店 指标 数据 3.11 3.10 3.9 3.8 3.7 3.6 3.5 3.4 3.3 3.2 3.1 神灯使用 酒店数 21 20 21 20 21 21 21 20 17 9 3 神灯活跃对话房间数 460 445 420 298 560 345 292 239 106 25 29 反馈总量 995 886 893 646 1,705 957 615 548 266 79 75 神灯活跃对话房间数/过夜房间夜 26% 28% 30% 30% 36% 23% 20% 18% 14% 7% 24% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行\n**发件人：**\n李勇桦 <­yonghua.li@delonixmail.com­>\n**时间：**\n2026-03-12T12:25:26.446Z（2026-03-12T12:25:26.446Z）2026-03-12T12:25:26.446Z\n</card>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-13T10:01:08+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b541517c6bca4b2efdad3345e1ac","msg_type":"post","content":"各位总经理：上午好，3月9日服务日报，请各位总经理查收。\n9号日报提到的**核心客诉：**9条重点投诉工单，问题较集中，主要是\n- 噪音问题（7条，占比近80%）：\n  - 包含邻居吵闹、马路车流噪音、电梯噪音，甚至有因施工影响宝宝睡觉的严重客诉。\n  - 建议：优化排房。在排房时，应将带小孩的家庭客、对睡眠要求高的客人，自动排在远离电梯、马路且非相邻的静音区。\n- 餐厅管理（2条）：客诉集中在“早餐被打包带走导致断餐”和“餐厅有人抽烟”。","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-12T09:23:28+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b541517c698a4b327441a3ead524","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card title=\"【日报】虫洞门店服务日报（3.9）\">\nDear all： 以下为虫洞（3.9）数据收集情况，请查收。 一、住中AI数据分析 1、数据概览（仅计入国内虫洞数据） • 虫洞直营店 指标 数据 3.9 3.8 3.7 3.6 3.5 3.4 3.3 3.2 3.1 神灯使用 酒店数 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 29 神灯活跃对话房间数 1,462 1,258 2,110 1,689 1,579 1,644 817 1,037 1,049 反馈总量 3,046 2,714 5,279 3,806 3,323 3,436 1,611 2,062 2,338 神灯活跃对话房间数/过夜房间夜 55% 52% 55% 56% 51% 60% 51% 50% 54% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行 54% 49% 48% 51% 46% 48% 44% 41% 46% 客服闭环 0.30% 0.50% 0.00% 0.10% 0.20% 0.20% 0.30% 0.10% 0.00% 小计 54% 50% 48% 51% 46% 49% 44% 41% 46% 调度酒店执行 AI调度 42% 45% 48% 45% 52% 49% 53% 57% 52% 客服调度 3.80% 5.00% 4.60% 4.30% 2.50% 2.80% 2.80% 2.50% 2.90% 小计 46% 50% 52% 49% 54% 52% 56% 59% 54% • 虫洞委托店 指标 数据 3.9 3.8 3.7 3.6 3.5 3.4 3.3 3.2 3.1 神灯使用 酒店数 21 20 21 21 21 20 17 9 3 神灯活跃对话房间数 421 298 560 345 292 239 106 25 29 反馈总量 871 646 1,705 957 615 548 266 79 75 神灯活跃对话房间数/过夜房间夜 30% 30% 36% 23% 20% 18% 14% 7% 24% 工单执行 客服与AI执行 AI执行 54% 50% 38% 41% 32% 38% 35% 41% 39% 客服闭环 0.50% 0.00% 0.10% 0.00% 0.20% 0.40% 0.40% 1.30% 0.00% 小计 54% 50% 38% 41% 32% 38% 35% 42% 39% 调度酒店执行 AI调\n**发件人：**\n李勇桦 <­yonghua.li@delonixmail.com­>\n**时间：**\n2026-03-10T12:07:32.803Z（2026-03-10T12:07:32.803Z）2026-03-10T12:07:32.803Z\n</card>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-12T09:23:28+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b55ca63dc9cc0b2c99776c5ce1c6","msg_type":"text","content":"<p>https://delonix.feishu.cn/wiki/WphswedTDiVYKqkBHYLcwfwznae?from=auth_notice&hash=f663bf0d16b27a9d81ee1ff65caaec68</p>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-10T17:22:25+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b55959a2b54a0b2813797db80fcc","msg_type":"post","content":"![image](img_v3_02vh_3c2eb15a-9d01-4109-8ff2-19a42fd9154g)\n昨日新增大众点评下载APP差评如上，已按规范进行回复","sender":{"id":"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a","sender_type":"user","name":"刘东东"},"create_time":"2026-03-06T08:18:22+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b55a4dae0e4a0b341afacb0191b9","msg_type":"file","content":"<file key=\"file_v3_00vg_826d145d-17b3-471f-97e5-b0731e1c33fg\" name=\"202601-02 虫洞小组及直营店-集团客服投诉.xlsx\"/>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-05T12:40:34+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b55a4dae0d8a8b2d9c8927cbdbf5","msg_type":"file","content":"<file key=\"file_v3_00vg_f6454300-ff9d-4e36-aa44-85de89ae0d7g\" name=\"202602 虫洞小组及直营店+OTA差评.xlsx\"/>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-05T12:40:34+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b55a4dae0b0acb4bfa6185bd9fa4","msg_type":"post","content":"各位总经理：中午好，近期，集团中央客服中心汇总了部分酒店的客人投诉记录，以及近期在各大OTA渠道（携程、美团等）产生的差评数据。今天我们在会上会向大家了解一下这些差评情况，请各位总经理对本店涉及的客诉和差评单进行复盘。会上我们会邀请部分总经理对以下两点进行说明：\n1. 当时现场的实际发生情况是什么？\n2. 事后采取了哪些实质性的挽回与追踪措施？（对客人的安抚补偿、对内部流程的优化或对相关责任人的处理）。请各位总经理知晓，谢谢。","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-03-05T12:40:34+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true}],"has_more":true,"page_token":"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMGvgJpAyyfJK_FZWeDRpwxANpFIYU7IU89Mp5e-azRMkb0h7KwIj65NWj5qsNSqYq6AN_foYmoHrqKBFXbNLsX2Dq3pOOofSfu4xzi7io2d-"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775592216978}}
{"type":"message","id":"67feb3fb","parentId":"5ca5e8bd","timestamp":"2026-04-07T20:03:37.082Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_wuc0hbgdpepe_2","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5266f2fbb4a8b26f53830e2c6b1\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"汇报提交统计\\\">\\n[按钮]\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T00:07:31+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53ca07e90ca0c2b9a7e3973cc96\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"汇报提交统计\\\">\\n[按钮]\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-04T00:02:26+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53dd723dc8a0c2ac22f37021a82\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"汇报提交统计\\\">\\n[按钮]\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-03T00:05:35+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53e0514298a4b215e006b93689e\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"汇报提交统计\\\">\\n[按钮]\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-02T00:04:09+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53f9db8a68f4b39cfc8cea4c63b\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"张惠的酒店市场销售本地市场及外拓市场拜访日报\\\">\\n**外拓拜访对象:** 海油工程长住\\n\\n**外拓主要事宜及取得的成果:** 店内接待海工长住入住，下载app及点亮神灯，后期还有同事过来办理入住，做好接待\\n\\n**外拓拜访现场水印拍照照片:** [图片，请在小程序中打开]\\n**其他事项（如认为有必要可填写，如无则写无）:** 无\\n\\n[查看详情]\\n📝 🖼️ 图片 [汇报](lark://client/app_profile?appId=cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c)\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"张惠\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T16:37:40+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53f8b0368d08b4c7c99b4e3755d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"夏美娟的酒店市场销售本地市场及外拓市场拜访日报\\\">\\n**外拓拜访对象:** 中远海运特种运输\\n\\n**外拓主要事宜及取得的成果:** 拜访中远海运特种运输张姐，今天巫总不在单位，与办公室张姐见面聊聊酒店下载APP，客人自己下订单的流程和益处，把做好的下载流程以及相关介绍文件面对面发送。方便更全面的了解，帮忙介绍给客人。\\n\\n**外拓拜访现场水印拍照照片:** [图片，请在小程序中打开]\\n**其他事项（如认为有必要可填写，如无则写无）:** 无\\n\\n[查看详情]\\n📝 🖼️ 图片 [汇报](lark://client/app_profile?appId=cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c)\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_33166a97b0d633a706e78ebb69907c80\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"夏美娟\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T15:57:35+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53f8bf28b4e4b26ebf5a0a21e0b\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"王鑫的酒店市场销售本地市场及外拓市场拜访日报\\\">\\n**外拓拜访对象:** 设计院\\n\\n**外拓主要事宜及取得的成果:** 上门送盖章账单讲解目前酒店神灯服务流程操作并邀请到店体验\\n\\n**外拓拜访现场水印拍照照片:** [图片，请在小程序中打开]\\n**其他事项（如认为有必要可填写，如无则写无）:** 无\\n\\n[查看详情]\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T15:54:06+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53f8dfb218e8c49b0dd0b795a7c\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"李勋的酒店市场销售本地市场及外拓市场拜访日报\\\">\\n**外拓拜访对象:** 拜访中交一航一\\n\\n**外拓主要事宜及取得的成果:** 接待中交一航一审计领导，到店参观客房、餐厅，会务组负责人交代重要性，用餐菜品了解，房间卫生情况！\\n\\n**外拓拜访现场水印拍照照片:** [图片，请在小程序中打开]\\n**其他事项（如认为有必要可填写，如无则写无）:** 无\\n\\n[查看详情]\\n📝 🖼️ 图片 [汇报](lark://client/app_profile?appId=cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c)\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"赵炳涛\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T15:28:24+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53feaedb40b4b4bb8978488c2f6\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"[image]\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_33166a97b0d633a706e78ebb69907c80\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"夏美娟\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T13:32:49+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": true,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538b49aec8acc35f9cdc65c29a9\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"汇报提交统计\\\">\\n[按钮]\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T00:04:06+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538c496284e8c104551e0e7d5b0\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"看到这条消息，我理解您在强调app下载和虫洞使用的宣导工作需要改进💪\\n为了给您提供更有针对性的建议，我想先了解几个问题：\\n1️⃣ **这个app具体是什么？** 是德胧集团的官方app还是某个特定工具？\\n2️⃣ **\\\"虫洞\\\"指的是什么？** 是某个功能模块、内部系统，还是其他的什么？\\n3️⃣ **当前的宣导方式是什么？** 目前已经在尝试哪些方法？\\n4️⃣ **优秀酒店的例子** - 您有看到过特别好的案例吗？可以分享一下吗？\\n等您补充这些信息后，我可以帮您：\\n- 分析当前宣导工作的短板\\n- 设计更有效的前置引导策略\\n- 制定可落地的行动方案\\n- 甚至用AI自动化工具辅助宣导工作\\n毕竟，**看到困难是第一步，但更重要的是找到突破口并立即行动** 🔥\\n您能补充一些细节吗？\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a93aa1cc63389cee\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T16:06:19+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b538c4a6150b8b2c5611b1d83c6f\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538c4a6150b8b2c5611b1d83c6f\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"这个app下载⏬、虫洞使用宣导，我们做得很不好，看看👀优秀酒店如何想尽办法做前置引导？我们做了么？ 只见困难，不见动作，那就原地被困住！@_all\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T16:05:30+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5383b18fd080b48aaf23b789c33\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"兄弟酒店🏨不仅自己在推，还说通会务组去帮忙前置宣传！ @_all\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T16:04:04+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5383b18fc8e0b2ca296b6bb3001\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210a_f8983e8c-2e4b-458e-a4a3-dab00d64931g)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T16:04:04+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5383f34cdc8cc340b2b0a19bb83\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"李勋的酒店市场销售本地市场及外拓市场拜访日报\\\">\\n**外拓拜访对象:** 拜访知识产权局\\n\\n**外拓主要事宜及取得的成果:** 拜访知识产权局，拜访办公室左主任正在开会，与董部长了解本年活动，市局委托办理活动，距离环境较为合适，目前外地出差距离原因暂时考虑周边，推荐百达卡、神灯服务等。\\n\\n**外拓拜访现场水印拍照照片:** [图片，请在小程序中打开]\\n**其他事项（如认为有必要可填写，如无则写无）:** 无\\n\\n[查看详情]\\n📝 🖼️ 图片 [汇报](lark://client/app_profile?appId=cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c)\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n  